            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EPeople are at the heart of everything we do. \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe \u003Ca target=\u0022\u0022 data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022/{localLink:7b9eee32-c36e-4d04-b0e9-d513830c713c}\u0022 title=\u0022Homepage\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022\u003Ebuild, support and host great websites\u003C/a\u003E and other digital experiences. Explore our services.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe\u2019re Sitecore and Microsoft Gold partners, Umbraco Platinum partners and ISO 27001 accredited. We work mainly with Sitecore, Umbraco, Azure, Optimizely and .NET. Explore our technologies.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe work with amazing clients. We\u2019re proud to be the trusted advisor and chosen technical partner for leading UK organisations.\u003C/p\u003E"
